		"habit": "mature open-grown tree 50 to 85 m tall, crown 10 to 20 m wide; in `01` about 3 times as tall as wide. Crown about 60 % of the height, the bare red trunk a little under 40 %. Widest at the buttressed foot; the crown is widest at about its lower third. A narrow cone with a rounded top on a huge tapering trunk. One stem.",
